          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "tool",
          "toolArgs",
          "dataSchema"
        ],
        "title": "YACVisInstantiateRequest",
        "description": "Re-render a template-generated visualization with a binding changed.\n\nStateless, like ``YACQueryRequest``: the caller sends back the provenance it\nreceived in the render's ``meta`` (``tool_used`` / ``tool_args``) together\nwith the same ``dataSchema``, and gets a freshly instantiated spec. Nothing\nis stored server-side, so any client that kept the provenance can re-bind —\nincluding one restoring a saved conversation."
      },
